From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tom <tompt@seznam.cz>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:27:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: correct the J120 accelerometer mount
 matrix

With the Home button down, the accelerometer reports negative Y. Inverting the two in-plane axes makes SensorProxy report bottom-up and rotates the display by 180 degrees. Use the identity matrix, verified via a runtime override in portrait and landscape.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8011-j120.dts | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8011-j120.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8011-j120.dts
index 426c16b41..c413f9169 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8011-j120.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8011-j120.dts
@@ -75,8 +75,8 @@ pressure {
 };
 
 &aop_accel {
-	mount-matrix = "-1", "0", "0",
-		       "0", "-1", "0",
+	mount-matrix = "1", "0", "0",
+		       "0", "1", "0",
 		       "0", "0", "1";
 };
 
